[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 1621.99, "timestamp": "00:27:01", "text": "スーパーチャットを送る機能を追加します。 誰か私にスーパー"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1627.029, "timestamp": "00:27:07", "text": "チャットで何か送ってよ。 音声を追加できます。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1629.43, "timestamp": "00:27:09", "text": "ああ、テキサス訛りのスピーチがここにある。 おお。 そうそう。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1631.59, "timestamp": "00:27:11", "text": "うん。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1635.35, "timestamp": "00:27:15", "text": "そうですね、もっとカスタマイズしたい、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1637.59, "timestamp": "00:27:17", "text": "つまり、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1639.99, "timestamp": "00:27:19", "text": "その機能のあらゆる側面を制御したいのであれば、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1642.63, "timestamp": "00:27:22", "text": "ストリーム要素を使うことをお勧めします。 まるで"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1645.909, "timestamp": "00:27:25", "text": "自分で警報システムを構築しているようなものだ。 それで、えっと、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1650.31, "timestamp": "00:27:30", "text": "私のモデルは、"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 1652.891, "timestamp": "00:27:32", "author": "@Shiori_mitsuki", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/Dn0VbakjSKrSNaXx6PyhznuqbomoCGx22ivSawRcMXp25Io7cfsud3H3qP-g9QprPJUESlxxtJA=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "okieee"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1654.39, "timestamp": "00:27:34", "text": "PNG のチューブのようなものが大きすぎることに気づきました。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1667.19, "timestamp": "00:27:47", "text": "メルトは時々すごく変なんです"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1669.59, "timestamp": "00:27:49", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1673.35, "timestamp": "00:27:53", "text": "はい、では、ご覧のとおり、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1676.63, "timestamp": "00:27:56", "text": "テキスト読み上げタイプですが、見えますか"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1679.43, "timestamp": "00:27:59", "text": "？ はい、"}]